      "writtenOn": "2021-05-15T01:16:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It could throw NotFoundException only if we input a random integer into getBoolean(). But in this case the input is R.bool.config_allow_pin_storage_for_unattended_reboot, which is guaranteed to be valid, so I don\u0027t think we need to catch that.\n\nChecking doesn\u0027t hurt I understand, but I think consistency is also important. We don\u0027t do this check in other places in telephony. Plus, let it crash rather than silently failed can help us catch a bigger problem in the future.",
